    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on darwin1859-ch12-05: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.85";
    dc:description "The empirical richness and endemism pattern is directly resolvable with global distribution data. The evolutionary explanation is less discriminating, but the claim's principal observable prediction is strong.";
