    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Calculate native endemic-species proportions for oceanic islands and matched continental areas as functions of area, isolation, and taxon. Test whether islands have unusually high endemism despite low richness.";
